{title: 13 Al Dios invisible}
{key: G}
{time: 3/4}
{lyricist: Walter; C; Smith, 1867 (1824-1908); Vers. esp.: Carlos A. Steger (1953- )}
{composer: Sr; Melodía tradicional galesa}

{sov}
1. [G]Al [C]Dios in-vi -sible, [Am][D7]al [Em]Rey [G]in-mortal,[D7][G]
2. Sin prisa, ni pausa, constante y le -al,
3. De cada ser vivo tú eres au-tor;
4. Se -ñor, te ro -dea in -fi -nito ful-gor;

[C]que habita en la al -tura [Am][D7]y en [Em]la san [G]-tidad;[D7][G]
[C]go -biernas el mundo [Am][D7]con [Em]soli [G]-citud;[D7][G]
[C]sus -tentas la vida [Am][D7]de [Em]todo [G]mortal.[D7][G]
[C]Los ánge -les [Am]cubren [D7]su [Em]rostro [G]an-te ti.[D7][G]

[Em]An-ciano [D]de [G]días, [Em]Se -ñor [G]sin igual,[D7]
[Em]tú muestras [D]a [G]todos [Em]jus -ticia [G]imparcial;[D7]
[Em]No-sotros [D]mo -rimos, [G]cual [Em]flor al [G]calor;[D7]
[Em]No-sotros [D]con [G]gran re-ve [Em]-rencia [G]y fervor,[D7]

[G]ren-dimos [C]ho -nores [D]con [Em]sin -ce [G]-ri[C]-dad.[D7][G]
[G]A -bundas [C]en gracia, [D]a -mor [Em]y [G]virtud.[C][D7][G]
[G]mas tú perma[C]-neces [D]por [Em]siempre [G]inmortal.[C][D7][G]
[G]te damos [C]sin-cera [D]ala -ban[Em]-za a [G]-quí.[C][D7][G]
{eov}
